      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/South_Park_Blocks"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "From 1972 to 1992, the Portland Poetry Festival and Park Block Revels turned the blocks into a living stage.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
