      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/South_Park_Blocks"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "In 1998 the city moved the annual “Tony n’ Tina’s Wedding” interactive theatre to the South Park Blocks, turning the park into a street‑theatre stage.",
